// Lead feedback round 12b (owner: "the police spawn too far"): a racer doing 2x the limit
// through Suburb at 12:00. Each unseen violation is a reckless-driving call; dispatch sends an
// available unit that can meet the racer within response.radius_m, or spawns a responder out
// of sight 150-350 m away along the roads (data/police/presence.toml [response]). Checks the
// call -> first unit within 100 m time and that no unit appears in a racer's view cone or
// closer than 120 m.
// Re-aimed on main's rebuilt grid (#19-#27: divided highway viaduct, diamond ramps) with round
// 12c's radar and witness pursuits: most runs now start with a witnessed pursuit before any call,
// so few calls are left to time (day suburb 3 calls in 8 runs) and responders cross the new
// highway by its ramps. Measured: 25 s reached 1 of 3, mean 22.6 s, max 31.5 s. Flagged to the lead as a regression to look at.
// Row 131 (2026-10-21): no spawn where the racer will see it within 3 s along its road, so
// responders appear past that look-ahead: mean 23.4 -> 26.6 s over the 3 timed calls (max 34.2 s
// unchanged). Cap 25 -> 28 s; trade-off reported to the lead.
// Row 157 (2026-10-23: heat gains halved): the 8 runs time only 3 calls, and their mean moved
// 26.5 -> 30.7 s on one call (max 37.1 -> 38.6 s). Same seeds, old vs new heat: 16 runs (9
// calls) 19.1 -> 20.4 s, 32 runs (15 calls) 15.2 -> 15.7 s. Runs 8 -> 16; worst-call cap 38 -> 40 s.
(
    name: "police_response_day_suburb",
    seed: 300,
    time_of_day_h: 12.0,
    duration_s: 60.0,
    runs: 16,
    racers: [(district: Suburb, speed_factor: 2.0)],
    expect: [
        (metric: "calls", min: 1.0, max: 10000.0),
        (metric: "call_reached_25s_frac", min: 0.33, max: 1.0),
        (metric: "call_to_unit_100m_s", min: 0.0, max: 28.0),
        // Row 84 (search extras): 34.2 -> 37.1 s, the worst of 3 calls. Not a cap squeeze (the
        // same with 2 cap slots reserved for calls): the extra search requests draw from the
        // seeded RNG and shift every later draw; with the extras off it is 34.6 s. Mean 27.5 s.
        (metric: "call_to_unit_100m_max_s", min: 0.0, max: 40.0),
        (metric: "spawns_in_view", min: 0.0, max: 0.0),
        (metric: "despawns_in_sight", min: 0.0, max: 0.0),
        (metric: "spawn_min_racer_m", min: 120.0, max: 10000.0),
    ],
)
